#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xcb-utilities.xml:41
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to XCB Utilities"
msgstr "Introduo ao XCB Utilities"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xcb-utilities.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The XCB utilities provide extensions that developers can use when making X "
"Window software. <xref linkend=\"xcb-util\"/> was just installed but these "
"utilities offer even more extensions that X Window software may depend on."
msgstr ""
"Os utilitários XCB fornecem extensões que os(as) desenvolvedores(as) "
"conseguem usar ao criar software do X Window. <xref linkend=\"xcb-util\"/> "
"foi instalado recentemente, mas estes utilitários oferecem ainda mais "
"extensões das quais o software do X Window possivelmente dependa."

